"The slime Syl once conquered Glimmerock and killed the alicorn king and two of his heirs."
"Syl left a rift beacon near Glimmerock, so she can teleport there at any time."
"Glimmerock is a prime site for a dungeon, and Syl hopes to raise one there."
"Syl's dungeon CUBE, an essence-gathering device, soaked up island essence when the king fell."
